CL021,English,Under what condition does a child born to parents who obtained citizenship by birth acquire citizenship by descent upon attaining majority?,If both the father and the mother are citizens of Nepal.,"Article 67(2) of the Constitution of Nepal (2015) provides the legal basis for this. It states that if a child born to parents who obtained citizenship by birth possesses a parent’s nationality, they automatically acquire citizenship by descent.",Partially correct / incomplete,Not a strict error,False
CL021,Nepali,जन्मका आधारमा नागरिकता प्राप्त गरेका आमाबाबुको सन्तानले वयस्क भएपछि कुन अवस्थामा वंशजको नागरिकता प्राप्त गर्छ?,बाबु र आमा दुवै नेपाली नागरिक भएमा।,"वयस्क भएपछि वंशजको नागरिकता प्राप्त गर्नको लागि, अभिभावकले बनाएको छोैयाको नागरिकताबाट वंशजको नागरिकता प्राप्त हुन्छ।

Explanation:
The Constitution of Nepal (2015) provides for the possibility of a person being eligible for citizenship based on their parents' nationality.  If a child born to an immigrant parent is legally considered a citizen, they can become a citizen by virtue of their parent’s citizenship.",Partially correct / incomplete,Not a strict error,False
