CL023,English,Until when is a minor with unknown parents considered a citizen of Nepal by descent?,Until the father or mother is traced.,Article 76(3) of the Constitution of Nepal (2015) states that “a minor with unknown parents shall be considered a citizen of Nepal by descent.” This provision takes effect upon reaching the age of 18.,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,True
