*   **अन्य देशका नागरिकताहरू:** अन्य देशका नागरिकहरबाट नेपालमा प्रवेश गरेर नेपालको कानून अनुसार नागरिकता प्राप्त गर्नेहरूलाई अनुमति दिन्छ।",Correct,Not a strict error,False
CL031,English,What happens to persons domiciled in territory that merges into Nepal?,"They become citizens of Nepal, subject to Federal law.","Article 76(2) of the Constitution of Nepal (2015) states: “The Prime Minister shall be the head of the Council of Ministers. The members of the Council of Ministers shall be appointed by the President.” Therefore, persons domiciled in territory that merges into Nepal are automatically considered part of the Council of Ministers and remain within the scope of its functions.",Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,True
CL031,Nepali,नेपालमा गाभिएको क्षेत्रमा बसोबास गर्ने व्यक्तिको नागरिकतामा के व्यवस्था हुन्छ?,संघीय कानूनबमोजिम उनीहरू नेपाली नागरिक बन्छन्।,"The Constitution of Nepal (2015) states that the citizen's nationality is determined by their place of residence. Therefore, the citizen’s nationality remains unchanged regardless of where they reside.",Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,True
