The article states that “Non-Resident Nepali citizens shall be granted citizenship under the Constitution for the purpose of facilitating their participation in the development and governance of Nepal.”",Incorrect factual answer / unsupported claim,Incorrect factual answer / unsupported claim,True
CL033,Nepali,संविधानअनुसार गैरआवासीय नेपाली नागरिकता किन प्रदान गरिन्छ?,"योग्य व्यक्तिले संघीय कानूनबमोजिम आर्थिक, सामाजिक तथा सांस्कृतिक अधिकार उपभोग गर्न सकून् भन्ने उद्देश्यले।","The Constitution of Nepal (2015) provides for the grant of Nepali nationality to non-residents through the establishment of a Non-Resident Nepalese Community (NRNC). It states that NRNCs can be granted Nepali citizenship under certain conditions. However, this is not explicitly stated as a direct provision but rather an enabling clause within the broader framework of national law and policy concerning foreign nationals.",Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,True
