PR015,Constitution & Law,Vice-President,Entity Identification,Medium,""According to the Constitution, what is the role and responsibility of the Vice-President in relation to natural resource benefits?"",The Vice-President performs the functions of the President during the President's absence.,The previous office becomes vacant automatically.,कार्यालय सञ्चालनका लागि आवश्यक कर्मचारी तथा अन्यआवश्यक व्यवस्था गर्नुपर्छ।,Article 68(a).,Art. 68(a),Constitution of Nepal (2015),https://lawcommission.gov.np/en/?cat=152,Constitution,,,,
PR016,Constitution & Law,Vice-President,Fact Retrieval,Easy,""According to the Constitution, what is the role and responsibility of the Vice-President in relation to natural resource benefits?"",The President resigns to the Vice-President, while the Vice-president resigns to the President.,राष्ट्रपतिले उपराष्ट्रपतिलाई राजीनामा दिन्छन् भने उपराष्ट्रपतिले राष्ट्रपतिलाई राजीनामा दिन्छन।,Compares Articles 65(a) and 68(a).,""Arts. 65(a), 68(a)"",Constitution of Nepal (2015),https://lawcommission.gov.np/en/?cat=152,Constitution,,,,
