FE004,Constitution & Law,Vice-President,Multi-hop Factual,Hard,""According to the Constitution, if a person holding a political office filled by election, nomination or appointment is appointed as the Vice-president, what happens to that office?"",The previous office becomes vacant automatically.,अघिल्लो पद स्वतः रिक्त हुन्छ।,Article 67(3).,Art. 67(3),Constitution of Nepal (2015),https://lawcommission.gov.np/en/?cat=152,Constitution,,,,
