FE003,Nepali,संविधानअनुसार नेपालको शासन सञ्चालनका लागि सामान्य निर्देशन जारी गर्ने तथा नियन्त्रण र नियमन गर्ने जिम्मेवारी कसको हुन्छ?,मन्त्रिपरिषद्।,The Constitution states that the Council of Ministers is responsible for issuing general directives and regulating the governance of Nepal. Article 75(1) defines the Council of Ministers as those who are responsible for this function.,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,True
