FL010,Nepali,अर्को सदनबाट अस्वीकृत वा संशोधन गरिने प्रक्रियाबाट कुन प्रकारको विधेयक बाहिर राखिएको छ?,धन विधेयक।,"The process of withdrawing or amending a bill due to the relocation of another resident is likely related to **land use and zoning regulations**.

