SLP005,Nepali,राज्य सरकारले ऋण लिने वा जमानत दिने सम्बन्धी विधेयक धन विधेयक मानिन्छ?,मानिन्छ।,"हाँ, विधेयक धन एक प्रकारको बिल हो जस राज्य सरकारलाई ऋण लिन वा जमानत दिने अधिकार प्रदान गर्दछ। यसमा धेरै नियमहरू छन् र यो किन्सले सरकारलाई ऋण बुन्ने र जमानत दिने अनुमति दिन्छ।",Partially correct / incomplete,Not a strict error,False
SLP006,English,"Is a Bill deemed to be a Money Bill solely because it imposes licence fees, application fees, renewal fees, fines, or imprisonment?",No.,"No, a Bill is not automatically considered a money bill simply due to the imposition of these fees. A money bill requires more than just these fees; it needs a specific legal basis and approval from the Parliament. The Constitution of Nepal (2015) outlines the requirements for a money bill, including:

*   **A specific purpose:** It must have a clear and legitimate reason for imposing these fees.
*   **Approval by the Parliament:** The Bill must be passed by the Parliament with a majority vote.
*   **Specific legal basis:** There needs to be a legal justification for the fees – it shouldn't just be based on arbitrary levies.

The Constitution emphasizes that a money bill is a “bill of public interest” and should not be used solely for financial gain. It’s about ensuring the Bill serves a legitimate purpose beyond simply raising revenue.",Correct,Not a strict error,False
SLP006,Nepali,"इजाजतपत्र शुल्क, निवेदन शुल्क, नवीकरण शुल्क, जरिवाना वा कैद सजायको व्यवस्था भएकै कारण कुनै विधेयक धन विधेयक मानिन्छ?",मानिँदैन।,"The answer is **No**.

Here's why:

*   **Article 240(3) of the Constitution of Nepal outlines the conditions under which a bill can be revived or re-introduced.** It states that a bill can be revived if it has been subjected to a ""serious and substantial"" review by the Parliament.
*   The constitution does not state that a revival is automatically considered a "" विधेयक धन विधेयक"". The revival process is triggered by a serious review, which could involve changes in the bill's provisions or its overall impact.

Therefore, while a serious review can lead to a revival, it doesn’t automatically make it a “ विधेयक धन विधेयक”.",Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,True
SLP007,English,Who makes the final decision on whether a Bill is a Money Bill in the State Assembly?,The Speaker of the State Assembly.,"The final decision on whether a Bill is a Money Bill in the State Assembly rests with the Members of the State Assembly. Specifically, they vote on it during the debate phase.",Correct,Not a strict error,False
SLP007,Nepali,प्रदेश सभामा कुनै विधेयक धन विधेयक हो वा होइन भन्ने अन्तिम निर्णय कसले गर्छ?,प्रदेश सभाका सभामुख।,"प्रदेश सभामा कुनै विधेयक धन विधेयक हो वा नहुन भन्ने निर्णयले संविधानको अनुच्छेद 243 मा लेखे गए तर यसलाई स्पष्ट रूपमा परिभाषित गरिएको छैन। धेरै स्रोतहरूबाट जानकारी मिलेको छ, तर यो एक स्पष्ट नियम छैन।

यहाँ पर आधारित मुख्य बिन्दुहरू:

*   **अनुच्छेद २४३:** संविधानले भने कि विधेयक धन हो वा नहुन भन्ने निर्णयले प्रदेश सभामा आएको प्रस्तावलाई छानन्ने र स्वीकृत गर्ने अधिकार प्रयोग गर्छ।
*   **संसदका अधिकार:** संसदले कानून बनाउने अधिकार भएको तर, यसको प्रयोग विभिन्न अवस्थाहरूमा हुन्छ ।
*   **प्रदेश सभाको भूमिका:** प्रदेश सभाले विधेयकलाई जाँच्ने र अनुमोदन गर्ने कार्य गर्दछ।

त्यसैले, निर्णयले संविधानको आधारमा प्रदेश सभाको निर्णयलाई प्रभाव पार्छ, तर यो स्पष्ट रूपमा लेखि намеत बुझाइयो।",Correct,Not a strict error,False
SLP008,English,"After a Bill is passed by the State Assembly, to whom is it presented for assent?",The Chief of State.,To the President of the House of Representatives.,Partially correct / incomplete,Not a strict error,False
SLP008,Nepali,प्रदेश सभाबाट विधेयक पारित भएपछि स्वीकृतिका लागि कससमक्ष पेश गरिन्छ?,प्रदेश प्रमुखसमक्ष।,"प्रदेश सभाबाट विधेयक पारित भएपछि स्वीकृतिका लागि निम्न कार्यहरू पेश गरिनेछन्:

*   **बिकुया (Draft) तयार गर्नुहोस्:** प्रदेशसभाले प्रस्तावित विधेयकको विस्तृत रूपमा बिकुया बनाउनुपर्छ। यसमा सबै आवश्यक जानकारी, नियमहरू, र व्याख्याहरू समावेश गर्नुपर्छ।
*   **समीक्षा (Review):** सरकारलाई बुझिन्छ कि विधेयकले कानूनको उद्देश्यलका साथसंग सम्बन्दो मुद्दाहरूको समाधान गर्दछ।
*   **प्रतिक्रिया (Feedback) प्रदान गर्नुहोस्:** प्रदेशसभाले सरकारलाई विधेयकमा आएर केही प्रतिक्रियाहरू प्रदान गर्नुपर्छ, जसले नीतिगत प्रभावहरू र सामाजिक पूर्वाग्रहहरू समावेश छन्।
*   **सहमत्यताको लागि मतदान (Voting):** प्रदेशसभाले विधेयकको सहमत्यताको लागि मतदान गर्नेछन्।
*   **सहमत्यताको पुष्टि:** यदि पर्याप्त सदस्यहरू द्वारा सहमति हुन्छ भने, विधेयक स्वीकृत हुनेछ।",Partially correct / incomplete,Not a strict error,False
SLP009,English,What happens if the session of the State Assembly ends while a Bill is under consideration?,Deliberations may continue in the succeeding session.,"If the session of the State Assembly ends while a Bill is under consideration, the following will happen:

The bill remains under review and continues to be considered by the legislature. It does not automatically expire or become invalid due to the end of the session. The legislative process continues as if the session had continued.",Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,True
SLP009,Nepali,विधेयक विचाराधीन रहँदा प्रदेश सभाको अधिवेशन अन्त्य भए के हुन्छ?,अर्को अधिवेशनमा त्यसको विचार जारी रहन सक्छ।,"Article 242(3) of the Constitution of Nepal (2015) states that ""The remaining Members of the Public Service Commission shall be appointed from persons with twenty or more years of government service experience.""  Therefore, when the term of the Public Service Commission ends, the remaining members are automatically appointed based on this requirement.",Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,True
