Therefore, it is permissible for the Chief of State to re-examine a Money Bill and propose amendments or changes.",Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,True
SLP014,Nepali,के प्रदेश प्रमुखले धन विधेयकलाई थप विचारका लागि प्रदेश सभामा फिर्ता पठाउन सक्छन्?,सक्दैनन्।,"Article 242(6) of the Constitution of Nepal lists the powers of the Regional Governor. It states that they can ""request the House of Representatives to consider the bill further."" This implies that the regional governor has the authority to request a reconsideration or further examination of a bill by the House of Representatives, which is a significant power within their role.",Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,True
