SFP009,English,Is approval of the State Assembly required for expenditures charged on the State Consolidated Fund?,No.,"No, approval is not required. Article 242(3) of the Constitution of Nepal states that the expenditure charges are to be borne by the state.",Correct,Not a strict error,False
SFP009,Nepali,प्रदेश सञ्चित कोषमा भारित खर्चका लागि प्रदेश सभाको स्वीकृति आवश्यक पर्छ?,पर्दैन।,"होय, प्रदेश सञ्चित कोषमा भारित खर्चका लागि प्रदेश सभाको स्वीकृति आवश्यक हुन्छ।

