SFP010,English,Which officials' remuneration and facilities are charged on the State Consolidated Fund?,State Speaker and State Deputy Speaker.,The answer is **the Auditor General**. Article 240(7) of the Constitution of Nepal specifies that the Auditor General can charge on the State Consolidated Fund.,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,True
SFP010,Nepali,कुन पदाधिकारीहरूको पारिश्रमिक र सुविधा प्रदेश सञ्चित कोषमा भारित हुन्छ?,प्रदेश सभामुख र प्रदेश उपसभामुख।,"Article 240(7) of the Constitution of Nepal provides the protection against disadvantageous alteration of the Auditor General's remuneration and conditions of service.  It states that ""Emergency declared due to extreme economic disarrays"" can lead to a change in this, but it is not explicitly detailed.",Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,True
SFP011,English,Are sums required to satisfy a court judgment or decree against the State Government charged on the State Consolidated Fund?,Yes.,"Yes, the State Government is obligated to pay sums required to satisfy a court judgment or decree against it. This is stipulated in Article 240(7) of the Constitution of Nepal (2015). Specifically, this provision states that “If a court order or decree requires the State Consolidated Fund to be charged, the State shall pay the necessary sums.”",Correct,Not a strict error,False
SFP011,Nepali,प्रदेश सरकारविरुद्ध अदालतको फैसला वा डिक्री पूरा गर्न आवश्यक रकम प्रदेश सञ्चित कोषमा भारित हुन्छ?,हुन्छ।,"Article 242(3) of the Constitution of Nepal outlines the requirements for the Public Service Commission (PSC) to determine the amount of funds required for a case against theप्रदेश सरकार.  It states that the remaining Members of the PSC must be appointed from individuals with twenty or more years of government service experience.

Therefore, the amount of funds required to complete the case will be proportionally weighted towards those with sufficient governmental experience.",Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,True
SFP012,English,Who lays the annual estimate of revenues and expenditures before the State Assembly?,State Minister for Finance.,"The Auditor General, महालेखा परीक्षक, lays the annual estimate of revenues and expenditures before the State Assembly.",Incorrect factual answer / unsupported claim,Incorrect factual answer / unsupported claim,True
