LE019,English,"What happens to a Village Assembly or Municipal Assembly member's office if they are elected as Chief, Deputy Chief, or Member of the District Coordination Committee?",The office of Village Assembly or Municipal Assembly member automatically lapses.,"The office becomes vacant.

