EC011,English,Is a Commissioner appointed under Article 245(2) eligible for reappointment?,"No, not eligible.","No, the Constitution does not explicitly state that a Commissioner is eligible for reappointment. It only mentions that they can be reappointed by the President. The text focuses on the appointment process and doesn’t detail specific requirements for continued service.",Correct,Not a strict error,False
EC011,Nepali,धारा २४५(२) बमोजिम नियुक्त निर्वाचन आयुक्त पुनः नियुक्तिका लागि योग्य हुन्छ?,"होइन, योग्य हुँदैन।","धारा २४५(२) बमोजिम, निर्वाचन आयुक्तको पुनर्संख्यानका लागि उपयुक्त व्यक्तिहरूलाई योग्य बनाउनुसँग सम्बन्धित तरतकारीले निर्णय गर्ने अधिकार हो।”,Article 245(2), Constitution of Nepal (2015),,,,,,

Explanation:
The constitution states that the Chief Electoral Commissioner can be appointed again only if they are deemed suitable by the competent authorities.",Partially correct / incomplete,Not a strict error,False
EC012,English,Can a Commissioner later be appointed as the Chief Election Commissioner?,Yes.,"No, a Commissioner cannot become the Chief Election Commissioner. The Constitution outlines specific qualifications and roles for this position. Article 267(3) of the Constitution states that “The President on the recommendation of the Council of Ministers shall appoint the Chief Election Commissioner.” This provision explicitly limits the appointment to the President’s discretion, ensuring accountability and adherence to established procedures.",Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,True
EC012,Nepali,के निर्वाचन आयुक्त पछि प्रमुख निर्वाचन आयुक्त नियुक्त हुन सक्छ?,सक्छ।,"हाँ, निर्वाचन आयुक्त पछि मुख्य निर्वाचन आयुक्त नियुक्त हुन सक्छ।

