EC013,English,What minimum educational qualification is required for appointment as Chief Election Commissioner or Commissioner?,Bachelor's degree from a recognized university.,The provided text doesn’t mention the minimum educational qualifications required for appointments to the Chief Election Commission or Commissioner. It focuses on the constitutional provisions related to the National Security Council and Nepal Army composition.,No answer / unsupported-context refusal,No answer / unsupported-context refusal,True
EC013,Nepali,प्रमुख निर्वाचन आयुक्त वा निर्वाचन आयुक्त नियुक्तिका लागि न्यूनतम शैक्षिक योग्यता के हो?,मान्यता प्राप्त विश्वविद्यालयबाट स्नातक उपाधि।,"Article 266(1)(a) states that the Minister for Defence is included as a member of the National Security Council. Therefore, the minimum educational qualification for being a Member of the National Security Council is **Minister for Defence**.",Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,True
EC014,English,Can a member of a political party at the time of appointment become Chief Election Commissioner or Commissioner?,No.,"No, according to Article 267(8) of the Constitution of Nepal, a Member of Parliament cannot be appointed as Chief Election Commissionor or Commissioner. The article states that only qualified individuals can hold these positions.",Correct,Not a strict error,False
EC014,Nepali,नियुक्तिको समयमा राजनीतिक दलको सदस्य रहेको व्यक्ति प्रमुख निर्वाचन आयुक्त वा आयुक्त बन्न सक्छ?,सक्दैन।,"उत्तर:
नेपाली संविधानले राजनीतिक दलको सदस्यको रूपमा समावेशयथँ, तर उनको कार्यकालमा एक विशिष्ट भूमिका हो - आयुक्त। यहाँ पर, उत्तरमा दिए गए प्रश्नमा, राजनीतिक दलको सदस्यको समयमा आयुक्तको पदमा प्रवेश गर्न सकिन्छ ।

यहाँ पर, संविधानले स्पष्ट रूप से बताउँछ कि राजनीतिक दलको सदस्यलाई आयुक्तको पदमा प्रवेश गर्न पाउँगाउनु पर्छ, तर यो केवल एक विशिष्ट भूमिका हो।",Correct,Not a strict error,False
EC015,English,What minimum age is required for appointment as Chief Election Commissioner or Commissioner?,Forty-five years.,"The Constitution does not specify a minimum age requirement for appointments to the Chief Election Commission or Commissioner. It states that the President will appoint them, and the appointment must be approved by the House of Representatives.",Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,True
EC015,Nepali,प्रमुख निर्वाचन आयुक्त वा निर्वाचन आयुक्त नियुक्तिका लागि न्यूनतम उमेर कति हो?,पैँतालीस वर्ष।,"Article 266(1)(a) states that the Minister for Defence is included as a member of the National Security Council. Therefore, the minimum age for appointment as a Member Secretary of the National Security Council is **30 years**.",Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,True
EC016,English,"Which elections does the Election Commission conduct, supervise, direct, and control?","President, Vice-President, Federal Parliament, State Assembly, and Local level elections.","The Election Commission conducts, supervises, directs, and controls elections at all levels. Specifically, it oversees the entire electoral process from voter registration to vote counting.",Incorrect factual answer / unsupported claim,Incorrect factual answer / unsupported claim,True
EC016,Nepali,"निर्वाचन आयोगले कुन-कुन निर्वाचन सञ्चालन, अनुगमन, निर्देशन र नियन्त्रण गर्छ?","राष्ट्रपति, उपराष्ट्रपति, संघीय संसद, प्रदेश सभा र स्थानीय तहका निर्वाचन।","Election Commission conducts the following operations:

*   **Polling Station Establishment and Management:** Establishing and managing polling stations.
*   **Voter Registration:** Registering voters.
*   **Election Monitoring:** Monitoring elections to ensure fair play.
*   **Direction and Supervision:** Providing direction and supervision to election officials.
*   **Accountability:** Ensuring accountability of election officials.",Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,True
