OC018,Nepali,"राष्ट्रिय दलित आयोगमा नियुक्तिका लागि दलित अधिकार, मानव अधिकार वा कानूनको क्षेत्रमा कति वर्षको उत्कृष्ट योगदान आवश्यक हुन्छ?",कम्तीमा दस वर्ष।,"The answer is: **Five**

The Constitution states that the National Commission for the Protection of Minorities (National दलित Commission) will evaluate the applicant's contribution within five years.",Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,True
OC019,English,In which fields must a person have rendered outstanding contribution to qualify as Chairperson or member of the National Dalit Commission?,"Rights and interests of the Dalit community, or human rights and law.",Article 267(7) of the Constitution of Nepal specifies that a person must have rendered outstanding contributions in at least one field to be eligible for the position of Chairperson or Member of the National Dalit Commission.,Partially correct / incomplete,Not a strict error,False
