NS008,English,How is the annual report of the National Security Council presented before the Federal Parliament?,The President causes it to be laid before the Federal Parliament through the Prime Minister.,The annual report of the National Security Council is submitted to the President through the Prime Minister.,Partially correct / incomplete,Not a strict error,False
