NS013,English,Which groups are specifically mentioned for ensuring inclusive entry into the Nepal Army under the Constitution?,"Women, Dalit, indigenous people, indigenous nationalities, Khas Arya, Madhesi, Tharu, Pichhada class, and backward region citizens.","Women, Dalit, आदिवासी, indigenous people, indigenous nationalities, Khas Arya, Madhesi, Tharu, Pichada class, and backward region citizens.",Correct,Not a strict error,False
NS013,Nepali,संविधानअनुसार नेपाली सेनामा समावेशी प्रवेश सुनिश्चित गरिने कुन-कुन समूहहरू उल्लेख गरिएका छन्?,"महिला, दलित, आदिवासी, आदिवासी जनजाति, खस आर्य, मधेसी, थारू, पिछडा वर्ग र पिछडिएको क्षेत्रका नागरिक।","महिला, दलित, आदिवासी, Khmer, Tharu, Pichada class, और backward region citizens.",Incorrect factual answer / unsupported claim,Incorrect factual answer / unsupported claim,True
