RI048,English,What are the four specific responsibilities of a Public Body under Section 4(2)?,"To classify and update information and make it public, publish, and broadcast it; make citizen access simple and easy; conduct functions openly and transparently; and provide staff with appropriate training and orientation.","The four specific responsibilities of a Public Body according to Section 4(2) of the Right to Information Act, 2064 (2007), are:

