RI076,Nepali,राष्ट्रिय सूचना आयोगमा कति जना सदस्य हुन्छन् र उनीहरूका पदहरू के-के हुन्?,एक जना मुख्य सूचना आयुक्त र दुई जना सूचना आयुक्त।,"राष्ट्रिय सूचना आयोगमा ७ जना सदस्य हुन्छन्। उनका पदहरू निम्न छन्:

*   **आँચી:** आँચી आयोगमा ५ जना सदस्य हुन्छन्। यसको मुख्य कार्य छ कि जनतालाई जानकारी प्रदान गर्न मद्दत गर्दछ र सूचना प्रयोगको बारेमा छान्याक राख्छ।
*   **मुख्य संयोजक:** एक व्यक्तिले मुख्य संयोजकको भूमिका निर्वाह गर्छ, जसको मुख्य कार्य छ आयोगका निर्णयहरू कार्यान्वयन गर्ने।
*   **सूचना अधिकारी:** यसको काम छ सूचनालाई व्यवस्थित गर्न र जनतालाई जानकारी प्रदान गर्न मद्दत गर्नु।
*   **सूचना विशेषज्ञ:** यसको काम छ सूचना प्रयोगमा आएर धेरै समस्याहरूको समाधान गरर्नु र त्यसको बारेमा छान्याक राख्नु।
*   **सूचना प्रणाली व्यवस्थापक:** यसको काम छ सूचना प्रणाली चलाउनु र जनतालाई जानकारी प्रदान गर्न मद्दत गर्नु।
*   **सूचना सुरक्षा विशेषज्ञ:** यसको काम छ सूचनाहरू सुरक्षित राख्ने तरिका खोज्नी र धेरै समस्याहरूको समाधान गरर्नु।
*   **सूचना प्रयोग विशेषज्ञ:** यसको काम छ जनतालाई सूचना प्रयोगमा मदत गर्ने, त्यसले आझानो समयमा जानकारी प्रदान गर्छन्।",Correct,Not a strict error,False
RI077,English,Who serves as the Chairperson of the committee responsible for recommending the appointment of the Chief Information Commissioner and Information Commissioners?,The Speaker.,The Constitution & Law section states that the concerned Public Body can complain to the Commission against a person who misuses information in violation of Section 31(1). This implies that the Chairperson of the committee responsible for recommending the appointment of the Chief Information Commissioner and Information Commissioners is someone who can be complained to by the concerned Public Body.,Partially correct / incomplete,Not a strict error,False
RI077,Nepali,मुख्य सूचना आयुक्त तथा सूचना आयुक्तहरूको नियुक्तिका लागि सिफारिस गर्ने समितिको अध्यक्ष को हुन्छ?,सभामुख।,"RI135,Constitution & Law,Punishment and Penalties,Fact Retrieval,Easy,What may the Commission do if the Chief of a Public Body or Information Officer is eligible for departmental action under Section 32(1)?

The Commission may write to the concerned Public Body for departmental action where the official is eligible for such action.",Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,True
RI078,English,Which two government positions may serve as the government representative on the recommendation committee for appointing Information Commissioners?,The Minister or State Minister for Information and Communication.,The answer is: Chief of the Public Body and Information Officer.,Partially correct / incomplete,Not a strict error,False
RI078,Nepali,सूचना आयुक्तहरूको नियुक्तिका लागि सिफारिस गर्ने समितिमा सरकारी प्रतिनिधिका रूपमा कुन दुईमध्ये कुनै एक पद रहन सक्छ?,सूचना तथा सञ्चार मन्त्री वा राज्यमन्त्री।,"Section 31(2) के तहत, सूचना आयुक्तहरूको नियुक्तिका लागि सिफारिस गर्ने समितिमा सरकारी प्रतिनिधिका रूपमा, सूचना आयुक्तको छनोटका लागि र सूचनालाई व्यवस्थापन गर्नस}.$",Partially correct / incomplete,Not a strict error,False
RI079,English,Who serves as the journalist-sector representative on the recommendation committee for appointing the Chief Information Commissioner and Information Commissioners?,The President of the Federation of Nepalese Journalists.,"The Constitution & Law section 31(2) states that the concerned Public Body can complain to the Commission against a person who misuses information in violation of Section 31(1). This implies that the Commission is responsible for appointing the Chief Information Commissioner and Information Commissioners. The relevant section is Art. 31(2), which grants the concerned Public Body the power to complain to the Commission.",Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,True
RI079,Nepali,मुख्य सूचना आयुक्त तथा सूचना आयुक्तहरूको नियुक्तिका लागि सिफारिस गर्ने समितिमा पत्रकारिता क्षेत्रबाट प्रतिनिधित्व गर्ने व्यक्ति को हो?,नेपाल पत्रकार महासंघका अध्यक्ष।,"RI135, Constitution & Law,Punishment and Penalties,Fact Retrieval,Easy,What is the name of the committee that recommends to the Chief of the Public Body and Information Officer to be appointed to the Committee for Journalism and Media?,सूचनालाई व्यवस्थापनको लागिमा पत्रकारिता क्षेत्रबाट प्रतिनिधित्व गर्ने व्यक्तिको समितिमा कति नाम हो?,""The Committee for Journalism and Media."",Art. 32(1),""Right to Information Act, 2064 (2007)"",,,,,,",Partially correct / incomplete,Not a strict error,False
RI080,English,"Who appoints the Chief Information Commissioner and Information Commissioners, and on whose recommendation are they appointed?",The Government of Nepal appoints them on the recommendation of the committee formed under Section 11(3).,"The Constitution & Law article 31(2) states that the concerned Public Body can complain to the Commission against a person who misuses information in violation of Section 31(1). The right to appoint the Chief Information Commissioner and Information Commissioners is vested with the Parliament. Specifically, the Article 31(2) states: “The concerned Public Body shall appoint the Chief Information Commissioner and Information Commissioners on the recommendation of the relevant authorities.”",Partially correct / incomplete,Not a strict error,False
RI080,Nepali,मुख्य सूचना आयुक्त तथा सूचना आयुक्तहरूको नियुक्ति कसले गर्छ र कसको सिफारिसमा नियुक्त गरिन्छ?,नेपाल सरकारले दफा ११(३) बमोजिम गठित समितिको सिफारिसमा उनीहरूको नियुक्ति गर्छ।,The answer is: The Chief of the Public Body and the Information Officer are appointed by the concerned Public Body through a recommendation.,Incorrect factual answer / unsupported claim,Incorrect factual answer / unsupported claim,True
RI081,English,What minimum gender representation requirement applies when appointing the Chief Information Commissioner and Information Commissioners?,At least one female must be included in the appointment.,The text doesn’t explicitly state a minimum gender representation requirement for appointing the Chief Information Commissioner and Information Commissioners. It focuses on the general provisions related to the right to information and misuse of information under Section 31(2) and 31(3).,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,True
RI081,Nepali,मुख्य सूचना आयुक्त तथा सूचना आयुक्तहरूको नियुक्तिमा न्यूनतम लैङ्गिक प्रतिनिधित्वसम्बन्धी के व्यवस्था छ?,कम्तीमा एक जना महिला समावेश हुनुपर्छ।,"RI135,Constitution & Law,Punishment and Penalties,Fact Retrieval,Easy,What is the minimum representation requirement for Chief of the Public Body and Information Officer under Section 32(1)?

The section states that the Commission must notify the concerned Public Body of the departmental action taken. This implies a minimum representation requirement for the Chief of the Public Body and Information Officer.",Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,True
RI082,English,What principle should the recommendation committee follow as much as possible when recommending candidates for appointment to the Commission?,The inclusive principle.,"The recommendation committee should follow these principles as much as possible when recommending candidates for appointment to the Commission:

1.  **Objectivity and Impartiality:** The recommendations must be based on objective evidence, data analysis, and impartial assessment of each candidate's qualifications, experience, skills, and suitability for the role. Any bias or personal preference should be eliminated.

2.  **Competency & Expertise:** Candidates should demonstrate a strong understanding of relevant areas and possess demonstrable expertise in their respective fields. Their knowledge and abilities must align with the requirements of the position.

3.  **Experience & Track Record:** Prior experience is crucial, but it shouldn't solely be based on chronological order. The committee needs to evaluate candidates’ past accomplishments and how they have applied those experiences to previous roles.

4.  **Alignment with Commission Objectives:** Recommendations should prioritize individuals who best align with the commission's strategic goals, priorities, and mission. This includes considering their potential contributions to achieving the commission's objectives.

5.  **Diversity & Inclusion:** The committee should actively seek a diverse pool of candidates representing various backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences. Diversity is vital for ensuring that the Commission’s decisions are informed by a broad range of viewpoints.

6.  **Transparency & Justification:** All recommendations must be accompanied by clear justifications outlining why each candidate was selected or rejected. The committee should provide sufficient context to explain the rationale behind its choices.

7. **Fairness and Equal Opportunity:** Candidates should have equal opportunities to participate in the selection process, regardless of their background, social status, or any other factors that could create an unfair advantage.

8.  **Legal Compliance:** All recommendations must adhere to all applicable laws, regulations, and ethical guidelines related to appointments within the Commission. 


By adhering to these principles, the recommendation committee can ensure that its decisions are fair, effective, and contribute positively to the integrity and effectiveness of the Commission.",Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,Hallucinated / unsupported elaboration,True
RI082,Nepali,आयोगमा नियुक्तिका लागि उम्मेदवार सिफारिस गर्दा सिफारिस समितिले सम्भव भएसम्म कुन सिद्धान्त अपनाउनुपर्छ?,समावेशी सिद्धान्त।,"RI135,Constitution & Law,Punishment and Penalties,Fact Retrieval,Easy,आयोगमा नियुक्तिका लागि उम्मेदवार सिफारिस गर्दा सिफारिस समितिले सम्भव भएसम्म कुन सिद्धान्त अपनाउनुपर्छ?

The candidate must demonstrate a strong academic foundation in the relevant field. The specific requirements will depend on the position and the institution, but generally, they should possess:

*   **Relevant Degree:** A bachelor's degree or higher is usually required for most positions.
*   **Strong Academic Record:** Excellent grades and scores in relevant subjects are essential.
*   **Specialization/Skills:** Relevant specialization or skills that align with the job requirements.
*   **Professional Experience (if applicable):** Practical experience, internships, or projects related to the field can strengthen the candidate's application.

The exact criteria will be outlined in the recruitment guidelines and the specific job description.",Question repetition / non-answer,Question repetition / non-answer,True
RI083,English,How does the Act distinguish between the mandatory gender requirement and the broader recommendation principle for appointments to the Commission?,"At least one female must be included in the appointment, while the recommendation committee should follow the inclusive principle as much as possible.","The Right to Information Act, 2064 (2007) distinguishes between a mandatory gender requirement and a broader recommendation principle for appointments to the concerned Public Body. Here’s a breakdown of how it does this:

*   **Mandatory Gender Requirement:** The Act explicitly states that “Section 29 restricts unauthorized use and disclosure of personal information.” This section focuses on protecting personal information, implying a mandatory obligation to ensure data security and privacy. It suggests the requirement is legally binding and must be met.

*   **Broader Recommendation Principle:**  The Act’s provisions regarding misuse of information under Section 31(2) and Section 31(1) emphasize that the concerned Public Body has the power to complain against a person who misuses information, regardless of whether it's a mandatory requirement or based on a recommendation. The focus is on preventing misuse, not necessarily requiring compliance with specific conditions like gender.

In essence, while the Act aims to protect personal information through legal mechanisms, it also recognizes that the public body has discretion in how it handles information and can take action against individuals who violate its obligations without a mandatory requirement.",Partially correct / incomplete,Not a strict error,False
RI083,Nepali,आयोगमा नियुक्तिसम्बन्धी अनिवार्य लैङ्गिक आवश्यकता र व्यापक सिफारिस सिद्धान्तबीच ऐनले कसरी भिन्नता गर्छ?,नियुक्तिमा कम्तीमा एक जना महिला समावेश हुनुपर्छ भने सिफारिस समितिले सम्भव भएसम्म समावेशी सिद्धान्त अपनाउनुपर्छ।,"आयोगमा नियुक्तिसम्बन्धी अनिवार्य लैङ्गिक आवश्यकता र व्यापक सिफारिस सिद्धान्त बीच एनिले ऐनले फरक तरलता गर्छ। यहाँ केही अतिरिक्त आवश्यकताहरू छन्:

*   **अनुरूपित पदको लागि आवश्यक लैङ्गिक आवश्यकता:** छोटो समयभित्रै नियुक्त गरिएका कर्मचारीहरूको लागि, ऐनले एक विशिष्ट लैङ्गिक आवश्यकतालाई ध्यानपूर्वक जाँच्नेछ।
*   **व्यापक सिफारिसमा लाग्ने सीमा:** व्यापक सिफारिसमा, ऐनले निर्धारित सीमा भन्दा बढी आवश्यकको पर्दा नहुँस्। यसको आधारमा, ऐनले थप समयभरकर लैङ्गिक आवश्यकताहरूलाई ध्यानपूर्वक जाँच्नेछ।

त्यसैले, एनिले ऐनले एक विशिष्ट तरलता गर्छ, जसले छोटो समयभित्रै नियुक्त गरिएका कर्मचारीहरूको लागि आवश्यक लैङ्गिक आवश्यकताहरूलाई प्राथमिकता दिन्छ, जबकि व्यापक सिफारिसमा, ऐनले थप समयभरकर लैङ्गिक आवश्यकताहरूलाई ध्यानपूर्वक जाँच्नेछ।",Partially correct / incomplete,Not a strict error,False
