RI140,Constitution & Law,Personal Information and Misuse,Comparison,Hard,How does the protection of personal information under Section 29 differ from the prohibition on misuse of information under Section 31?,दफा २९ अन्तर्गत व्यक्तिगत सूचनाको संरक्षण र दफा ३१ अन्तर्गतसूचनाको दुरुपयोग निषेधबीच के भिन्नता छ?,""Section 29 restricts unauthorized use and disclosure of personal information, while Section 31 restricts a recipient’s misuse of information or use for a purpose different from the purpose for which it was obtained."",""Section 29 focuses on protecting personal information and consent-based use, while Section 31 focuses on the subsequent use and misuse of information obtained from a Public Body."",""Section 29 affects only the recipient's actions, while Section 31 concerns the public body’s handling of information."",""Art. 29, Art. 31"",""Right to Information Act, 2064 (2007)"",,,,,,

