RI143,Constitution & Law,Punishment and Penalties,Fact Retrieval,Medium,""Which two officials may be fined under Section 32(1) for unjustifiably withholding, refusing, partially providing, or providing wrong information, or destroying information?，”सूचना लुकाउने, दिन अस्वीकार गर्ने, आंशिक वा गलत सूचना दिने वा सूचना नष्ट गर्ने कार्यका लागि दफा ३२(१) अन्तर्गत कुन दुई पदाधिकारीलाई जरिवाना गर्न सकिन्छ?,The Chief of the Public Body and the Information Officer.,सार्वजनिक निकायको प्रमुख र सूचना अधिकारी।,Section 32(1) specifically applies to the Chief of a Public Body or the Information Officer.,Art. 32(1),""Right to Information Act, 2064 (2007)"",,,,,,

RI144,Constitution & Law,Punishment and Penalties,Comparison,Medium,""How does the penalty for unjustified delay in providing information that should have been provided within the prescribed time?,”सूचना उपलब्ध गराउनुपर्ने समयमा बिना कारण ढिला गरी उपलब्ध गराएमा दैनिक कति जरिवाना लाग्छ?,Unjustified delay attracts NPR 200 per day of delay.,ढिलाइ भएको प्रत्येक दिन रु. २०० जरिवाना।"",""Section 32(1) authorizes the Commission to impose a fine of NPR 1,000 to NPR 25,000 for these forms of improper handling of information."",Art. 32(1),""Right to Information Act, 2064 (2007)"",,,,,,

