RI109,English,Who chairs the committee responsible for classifying information held by Public Bodies at the policy level?,The Chief Secretary of the Government of Nepal.,"RI135,Punishment and Penalties,Fact Retrieval,Easy,The Chief of the Public Body or Information Officer.",Partially correct / incomplete,Not a strict error,False
